<title>UK: Allied Colloids' Fisher resigns from group.</title>
<headline>Allied Colloids' Fisher resigns from group.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-09-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Allied Colloids Group Plc said on Monday that Brian Fisher, director of logistics and safety, has resigned from the company.</p>
<p>The group gave no further details.</p>
<p>This latest departure came as the company sought to build a &quot;team for the future,&quot; it said.</p>
<p>-- London newsroom +44 171 542 7717</p>
